# Generated content is meant to be committed by default (it's the point of
# this repo), but ignore the actual markdown files if you'd rather keep your
# posts private and only version the skills/folder structure. Uncomment to
# use that mode:
# content/**/*.md
# !content/README.md
# !content/hooks/hook-library.md
# !content/cta/cta-library.md
# !content/**/.gitkeep
